    text: "PR #1353 scoped documentation continuation: complete live metadata/comments and all 34 full history events were read, with no omission receipt and no active owner. The current AST census found 4153 filler comments before this batch; three get option/result comments were already replaced, leaving 4150. This pass will replace remaining filler in src/sdk/query/get.ts, src/sdk/merge/install.ts, and src/cli/register-list-query.ts and document their named callables with current projection, history, Git, and transport semantics. Only the reviewed per-file census reductions will be generated. The repository-wide semantic documentation debt remains open here and is not equivalent to the separate 100 percent presence metric."
