    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Scoped documentation proof for PR #1353: TypeScript AST printing with comments removed is identical before/after the documentation-only tranche in all three affected modules. Named-callable census is 24/24 in sdk/query/get, 21/21 in sdk/merge/install, and 25/25 in cli/register-list-query. All 19 original filler comments in those modules now describe actual projection, ownership/history, Git persistence, runtime matching, and transport policy. Supported baseline generation removed only their reviewed 13/2/4 entries; the global corpus remains 4134 filler comments in 204 of 758 maintained source files. That remaining debt is not claimed complete. Negative controls and 100 percent source/export/member presence gates will remain required."
