    text: "PR #1353 documentation tranche removed all 19 legacy filler entries from the three touched runtime modules (get 13, merge install 2, read registration 4). All 70 named callables in those modules have contract comments; normalized TypeScript AST comparison before/after the documentation-only edits is identical. The generated ratchet baseline removes three entries and increases no ceiling. Global remaining census is 4134 filler entries in 204 of 758 maintained-source files: the presence gate is not a proof of globally meaningful documentation, and this broader canonical chore remains unfinished. The full runner includes negative controls for filler growth and baseline drift; final verification is pending."
