    text: "Linked validation correctly refused the two older branch-provenance commands (pnpm build and pnpm quality:docstrings); the new negative-control suite passed 3/3. Both refused commands have been inspected in current package scripts and already run directly during this batch. Acknowledge these exact current commands through the supported clone-local trust mechanism, then rerun the existing linked set. No allow-untrusted policy or trust gate will be relaxed."
