    text: "Live quality observation during GH-1365 through GH-1369 delivery: quality:docstrings scans 762 files and reports 4,133 existing filler descriptions across 204 files. The ratchet passes without weakening it, but this is not evidence that all repository docstrings meet the requested semantic quality. Reusing this canonical open owner; no duplicate item or additional in-progress claim. New helpers in the active batch describe producer attribution and ancestor-option preparation concretely."
